## House style
- Address clients as "Dear Sir / Madam" unless a name is given.
- Subject lines start with the client name and period, for example: "ABC Traders - GSTR-3B for September 2026 - Documents required".
- Dates in the form 19 October 2026.
- Amounts in the form ₹12,34,567 (Indian grouping).
- Standard fee-note footer: "Our fees are exclusive of GST at 18% and out-of-pocket expenses."

## Tools the firm uses (so agents can refer to them)
